<title>USA: Amer Mgmt sees 96 revs at about $800 mln.</title>
<headline>Amer Mgmt sees 96 revs at about $800 mln.</headline>
<dateline>FAIRFAX, Va. 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Management Systems Inc Thursday said it expects 1996 revenues to be about $800 million and expects worldwide hiring to exceed 2,100 by mid-1997.</p>
<p>The business and information technology consulting firm said it would undertake record levels of hiring and lease additional facilities to meet growing business demand. The company currently has over 7,000 employees and 49 offices in North America and Europe.  </p>
<p>AMS's revenues for 1995 were $632 million.</p>
</text>
